# Post-change verification

After any code change in this repository:

1. `npm run check:types` must complete with no errors
2. `npm run lint` must complete with no errors (max warnings: 0)
3. `npm run test` must complete with no errors

If any `src/**/*.css` or `src/**/*.scss` file was added or modified, also run:

4. `npm run lint:styles` must complete with no errors (max warnings: 0)

If any command fails, fix the issues before considering the work done.

Full check (always):

```bash
npm run check:types && npm run lint && npm run test
```

When style files changed, append Stylelint:

```bash
npm run check:types && npm run lint && npm run lint:styles && npm run test
```

VS Code theme variables (`--vscode-*`) and BEM-style class names are allowed when needed; add the same file-level disables used in `Settings.scss` and `StartWorkHeader.scss`:

```scss
/* stylelint-disable custom-property-pattern */
/* stylelint-disable selector-class-pattern */
```
